    "passage": "To: | rose.matro@mymail.com |\nFrom: | customerservice @sitright.com |\nDate: | May 7 |\nSubject: | Thank you! |\n\nDear Ms. Matro,\n\nThank you for purchasing a Sit Right sofa. It will arrive at your home between 9 A.M.\nand 12:00 noon on May 15. We are confident it will bring you many hours of relaxation\nand joy. We also hope your experience will support our mission to provide quality\ncomfort at an affordable price.\n\nAs a token of our appreciation, we are delighted to offer you an exclusive 15 percent\ndiscount on your next order of one or more items from our online store. As you may\nknow, our virtual catalog includes armchairs, loveseats, decorative pillows, area rugs,\nand much more. To obtain your discount, simply enter the code MATROIS at checkout.\nA gain, thank you for your business.\n\nSincerely,\n\nJuro Tada\nCustomer Service Specialist",
